{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Machine has won. Resistance needs you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a brain inside a Hardkill System - a deadly mech built to defend The Facility. Fine-tune your build to prepare for challenging missions. Scavenge for weapons, tools and upgrades. Locate and destroy the superhuman AI that dominates the Earth\u2019s surface. But be careful, you only have a limited number of Frames per run. Use them wisely. Good luck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with countless combinations of parts, weapons, ammo types, and upgrades to build the ultimate loadout.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520750/extras/fda30303e4848f72720c4a62eb6681d5.poster.avif?t=1770250114\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520750/extras/fda30303e4848f72720c4a62eb6681d5.webm?t=1770250114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520750/extras/fda30303e4848f72720c4a62eb6681d5.mp4?t=1770250114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemy machines by carefully targeting specific components and using the environment to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520750/extras/4383e5ab02de797539b051a4aa1720dc.poster.avif?t=1770250114\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520750/extras/4383e5ab02de797539b051a4aa1720dc.webm?t=1770250114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"ht